flowchart TB
    Q(["Staff member opens the portal"]):::start --> MQ["My queue shows only the stages this role decides<br/>Admin: SUBMITTED and FINAL_APPROVAL<br/>IT, Technical, Literature: their own stage"]:::blue
    MQ --> OPEN["Open an article"]:::blue
    OPEN --> ACC{{"Is it in a stage<br/>this role can see?"}}:::amber
    ACC -->|"No"| NF["Article not found in your queues<br/>same answer for missing and not yours"]:::red
    ACC -->|"Yes"| READ["Read the Google Doc, similarity and AI reports<br/>signed links that expire after 10 minutes<br/>read authors, description, keywords, history"]:::blue
    READ --> NOTE["Optional: add an internal note<br/>staff only, cannot be edited or deleted"]:::grey
    READ --> D{{"Decision"}}:::amber
    NOTE --> D
    D -->|"Approve"| A1["Confirmation dialog"]:::blue --> A2["Moves exactly one stage forward<br/>no email"]:::green
    D -->|"Request changes"| R1["Reason of 10+ characters<br/>explains what to fix"]:::blue --> R2["Confirmation dialog shows the reason"]:::blue --> R3["CHANGES_REQUESTED<br/>return_to_stage remembers this stage<br/>reason shown to the contributor<br/>email sent with the reason"]:::amber
    D -->|"Reject"| J1["Reason of 10+ characters"]:::blue --> J2["Confirmation dialog shows the reason"]:::blue --> J3["REJECTED<br/>rejected_at_stage remembers this stage<br/>reason shown to the contributor<br/>email sent with the reason"]:::red
    A2 --> LEAVE["Article leaves this person's queue<br/>reviewers return to the queue list"]:::grey
    R3 --> LEAVE
    J3 --> LEAVE
    R3 -.->|"contributor sends a revision"| BACK["Article returns to this same stage<br/>Revision received email<br/>appears in this queue again"]:::green
    LIT["Literature reviewers can also suggest archive tags<br/>the admin makes the final choice"]:::gold -.-> READ

